  "title": "IHG One Rewards Partners with Live Nation Asia across the Greater China region to Unlock Exclusive Concert Experiences for Travellers",
  "summary": "17 August 2026, Shanghai – IHG One Rewards, the global loyalty programme of IHG Hotels & Resorts, today announced a partnership with Live Nation Asia across the Greater China region, bringing together hospitality with live entertainment. As part of this, new and existing IHG One Rewards members will have access to exclusive travel experiences in Hong Kong and Taiwan markets that pair stays at IHG Hotels & Resorts with select concerts, along with member-exclusive ticket giveaways and promotions across IHG One Rewards platforms and social media channels.",
